    "question": "In a 5-day Fishing competition, Jackson was able to reel a total of 6 fishes per day, Jonah was able to reel 4 fishes per day and George was able to reel 8 fishes per day. How many fishes were they able to catch throughout the competition if they are on the same team?",
    "gold": "90",
    "answer": "Jackson gets a total of 6x5= <<6*5=30>>30 fishes after the competition.\nJonah gets 4x5= <<4*5=20>>20 fishes after the competition.\nAnd George was able to get 8x5=<<8*5=40>>40 fishes after the competition.\nTherefore the total fishes they were able to get for their team is 30+20+40= <<30+20+40=90>>90.\n#### 90"
